platforms-headless-no-feature = Headless · no feature
platforms-app-memory-records-the-semantic-tree-and-typed-patches = App::memory() records the semantic tree and typed patches for tests. Profile::RECORD performs no layout. There is no physical input, focus, geometry, or platform action driver.
platforms-web-csr-web = Web CSR · web
